               <div type="div3">
                  <head>MUSIC CREDITS</head>
                  <div type="div4">
                     <head>Scene 1.1 Onward Christian Soldiers, Salvation Army Band Bands of the Salvation Army Album: Jerusalem Year 2003</head>
                     <div type="div5">
                        <head>Scene 1.5 Scanned/music for lungs and bellows. Will Duke, concertinas, voice; Dan Quinn, melodeons, voice. 2001, Hebemusic HEBE CD 003 and Onward Christian Soldiers, Salvation Army Band Bands of the Salvation Army Album: Jerusalem Year 2003</head>
                     </div>
                     <div type="div5">
                        <head>Scene 2.1 The Big Day In. Simon Thoumire, concertina; David Milligan, piano, 2001, Foot Stompin' Records CDFSR17B</head>
                     </div>
                     <div type="div5">
                        <head>Scene 2.8 Bach Preludio Partita 3 http://www.concertinaconnection.com/partita3prelude.mp3 and Onward Christian Soldiers, Salvation Army Band Bands of the Salvation Army Album: Jerusalem Year 2003</head>
                     </div>
                     <div type="div5">
                        <head>Scene 3.1 Andante from Italian Concerto BWV 971 - Bach Catrin Finch (harp) http://www.gardnermuseum.org/music/listen</head>
                     </div>
                     <div type="div5">
                        <head>Scene 3.5 Orfeo ed Euridice (excerpt) - Gluck Paula Robison (flute) Mariko Anraku (harp) http://www.gardnermuseum.org/music/listen Scene 3.9 same</head>
                        <p rend="justify">Recorded December 22, 2011 at the Ensemble Studio Theatre, New York City.</p>
